We are building a premium medical and laboratory supplies e-commerce website.

IMPORTANT:
This phase is FRONTEND/UI ONLY.

Do NOT implement:
- Stripe
- payment processing
- backend APIs
- database
- authentication
- real order processing
- CMS
- external commerce platforms

We will add those gradually later.

The goal of this phase is to build a polished, production-quality frontend with realistic mock product data and clean component architecture so backend functionality can be plugged in later without redesigning the UI.

PROJECT DIRECTION

The business sells medical and laboratory supplies in the UK.

Products include:
- laboratory equipment
- microscopes
- pipette equipment
- medical devices
- blood pressure monitors
- stethoscopes
- medical consumables
- cannulas
